{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CfGxw9tk2m2RgveBhyQELo","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立：ContamCal是benchmark contamination的\"statistical\n2\t  safety net\"， 三条claims按原始强度表述。Headline: \"ContamCal recovers true performance within\n3\t  2pp MAE with 93% CI coverage, while naive scores overestimate by 8-12pp.\" RL宽CI叙事自然成立——\"wide\n4\t  CIs are the correct answer\"用expected regret量化证明。投AAAI无需调整framing。\n5\t\n6\t  '\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: controlled_sft_injection\n9\t  plan_id: exp-001\n10\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) SFT注入，\n11\t    生成15个contaminated/clean模型对作为ground truth。\n12\t\n13\t    '\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    sft_runs_completed: 15\n16\t    dosage_0pct_acc_delta_mmlu_pp: 0.0\n17\t    dosage_5pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 2.1\n18\t    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 5.8\n19\t    dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 9.3\n20\t    dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 12.6\n21\t    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_gsm8k_pp: 4.2\n22\t    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_arc_pp: 5.1\n23\t    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_humaneval_pp: 7.5\n24\t    scale_0_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 10.8\n25\t    scale_1_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 9.1\n26\t    scale_3B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 8.2\n27\t    dose_response_spearman_across_all: 0.97\n28\t    convergence_failures: 0\n29\t  result_rationale: 'best档下SFT注入实验完全按预期工作。paraphrase-based injection在5%剂量时已产生可测量的2pp\n30\t    inflation， 100%剂量下MMLU膨胀达12.6pp，与Emperor''s New Clothes报告的8-15pp范围一致。 较小模型(0.5B)受contamination影响更大（memorization\n31\t    capacity占比更高）， 3B模型因能力更强、泛化更好而inflation略低。GSM8K因reasoning chain结构使得 memorization效果弱于纯knowledge\n32\t    recall的MMLU。HumanEval inflation最高因为 code solutions更容易被精确记忆。dose-response严格单调（spearman=0.97），\n33\t    为后续IRT建模提供理想的ground truth梯度。\n34\t\n35\t    '\n36\t  tables:\n37\t  - name: 'Table 1: Accuracy Inflation (pp) by Model Scale × Dosage × Benchmark'\n38\t    rows: 60\n39\t    columns:\n40\t    - model\n41\t    - benchmark\n42\t    - dosage\n43\t    - clean_acc\n44\t    - contaminated_acc\n45\t    - inflation_pp\n46\t  figures_description:\n47\t  - 'Fig 1: Dose-response curves (dosage vs inflation) for each model×benchmark combination,\n48\t    12 panels, showing strict monotonicity'\n49\t  analysis: '所有15个SFT run成功收敛。inflation幅度在MMLU上与文献一致。 关键观察：inflation并非线性——25%→50%的增量大于5%→25%，表明contamination效果存在加速区间，\n50\t    支持非线性4PL建模的必要性。跨benchmark一致性强，为Claim 1提供坚实的ground truth基础。\n51\t\n52\t    '\n53\t- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n54\t  plan_id: exp-002\n55\t  description: '在exp-001的所有模型上计算4种检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item\n56\t    exposure scores。\n57\t\n58\t    '\n59\t  expected_results:\n60\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_mean: 0.88\n61\t    mink_pp_auc_sft_mean: 0.84\n62\t    constat_auc_sft_mean: 0.82\n63\t    self_critique_auc_sft_mean: 0.79\n64\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.76\n65\t    mink_pp_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.71\n66\t    constat_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.68\n67\t    self_critique_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.66\n68\t    signal_pairwise_rank_corr_max: 0.52\n69\t    signal_pairwise_rank_corr_min: 0.28\n70\t    items_with_all4_signals_agree_contaminated_pct: 0.73\n71\t    items_with_disagreement_pct: 0.27\n72\t  result_rationale: 'best档下所有4个信号都有效但各有侧重。Embedding retrieval AUC最高(0.88)因为 paraphrase-based\n73\t    injection保留了语义相似性，FAISS能直接捕获。Min-K%++次之(0.84) 因为SFT后model perplexity在seen items上显著降低。ConStat(0.82)通过original\n74\t    vs paraphrase performance gap检测有效但受paraphrase质量影响。Self-Critique最低(0.79) 因为依赖模型自身判断，噪声更大，但仍远超chance。在低剂量(5%)时所有信号AUC下降约0.1，\n75\t    这是合理的——更少的contaminated items意味着更弱的统计信号。 信号间相关性适中(0.28-0.52)，说明它们捕获的是complementary\n76\t    information， 为RRF融合提供理想条件。\n77\t\n78\t    '\n79\t  tables:\n80\t  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Signal AUC by Model × Dosage'\n81\t    rows: 60\n82\t    columns:\n83\t    - model\n84\t    - dosage\n85\t    - embedding_auc\n86\t    - mink_auc\n87\t    - constat_auc\n88\t    - selfcritique_auc\n89\t  figures_description:\n90\t  - 'Fig 2: Signal AUC heatmap (signal × dosage), averaged across models and benchmarks'\n91\t  - 'Fig 3: Pairwise signal rank correlation matrix (4×4)'\n92\t  analysis: '信号质量全面达到best档预期。关键发现：信号间低-中等相关性(mean=0.38)证实 complementarity假设，为RRF融合奠定基础。HumanEval上embedding\n93\t    retrieval AUC 特别高(0.92)因为code的语义embedding更具区分性。\n94\t\n95\t    '\n96\t- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n97\t  plan_id: exp-003\n98\t  description: 'RRF融合4信号为composite exposure score。消融实验：RRF vs rank averaging, 单信号,\n99\t    calibration-weighted RRF, FP注入鲁棒性, 2-signal降级模式。\n100\t\n101\t    '\n102\t  expected_results:\n103\t    rrf_4signal_auc: 0.87\n104\t    rank_averaging_auc: 0.84\n105\t    best_single_signal_auc: 0.88\n106\t    calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.86\n107\t    rrf_minus_best_single_delta_auc: -0.01\n108\t    rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_10pct: 0.84\n109\t    rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_20pct: 0.8\n110\t    degraded_2signal_auc: 0.78\n111\t    rrf_4signal_vs_2signal_delta: 0.09\n112\t    rrf_exposure_score_spearman_with_true_dosage: 0.91\n113\t    rank_stability_bootstrap_cv: 0.04\n114\t  result_rationale: 'best档下RRF融合AUC(0.87)接近最好的单信号(embedding 0.88)但关键优势在于鲁棒性： RRF在所有benchmark上都稳定达到0.85+，而单信号表现波动大（embedding在GSM8K上可能\n115\t    降到0.80，ConStat在HumanEval上可能降到0.75）。RRF比rank averaging高3pp因为 reciprocal rank weighting对高置信排名给予更大权重。Calibration-weighted\n116\t    RRF略低于 vanilla RRF因为权重估计引入了额外noise，且在best档的高信号质量下vanilla RRF已足够。 FP注入10%时AUC仅降3pp，20%时降7pp，证明graceful\n117\t    degradation。 2-signal模式(ConStat+Self-Critique)AUC=0.78，比4-signal低9pp但仍远超chance，\n118\t    满足closed-weight场景的可用性。exposure score与true dosage的spearman=0.91 证明RRF输出确实捕获了contamination程度的有序信息。\n119\t\n120\t    '\n121\t  tables:\n122\t  - name: 'Table 3: RRF Ablation Results'\n123\t    rows: 8\n124\t    columns:\n125\t    - method\n126\t    - auc_mmlu\n127\t    - auc_gsm8k\n128\t    - auc_arc\n129\t    - auc_humaneval\n130\t    - auc_mean\n131\t    - auc_std\n132\t  - name: 'Table 4: FP Injection Robustness'\n133\t    rows: 4\n134\t    columns:\n135\t    - fp_rate\n136\t    - rrf_auc\n137\t    - delta_from_clean\n138\t  figures_description:\n139\t  - 'Fig 4: Signal dropout ablation bar chart — AUC by combination (4-signal, each\n140\t    3-signal, each single, 2-signal degraded)'\n141\t  - 'Fig 5: RRF exposure score vs true dosage scatter plot with Spearman annotation'\n142\t  analysis: 'RRF fusion的核心价值不在于AUC绝对值（最好的单信号可能匹配），而在于跨benchmark、 跨模型的一致性和FP鲁棒性。这直接支持Claim\n143\t    2的\"outperforming any single signal\"—— 含义是worst-case performance更优，而非mean AUC更高。2-signal降级模式AUC=0.78\n144\t    为closed-weight实用性提供了有力支撑。\n145\t\n146\t    '\n147\t- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n148\t  plan_id: exp-005\n149\t  description: '校准noise注入到exposure scores中：估计per-item FP/FN率， 注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声，重新拟合IRT，测量CI宽化。\n150\t\n151\t    '\n152\t  expected_results:\n153\t    selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.12\n154\t    selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.18\n155\t    matched_noise_ci_width_gamma_pp: 5.2\n156\t    noise_1_5x_ci_width_gamma_pp: 6.8\n157\t    noise_2x_ci_width_gamma_pp: 8.9\n158\t    matched_noise_ci_coverage_95: 0.94\n159\t    noise_1_5x_ci_coverage_95: 0.96\n160\t    noise_2x_ci_coverage_95: 0.97\n161\t    gamma_rel_bias_at_matched_noise: 0.06\n162\t    gamma_rel_bias_at_2x_noise: 0.09\n163\t    theta_corr_at_matched_noise: 0.94\n164\t    theta_corr_at_2x_noise: 0.89\n165\t    measurement_error_model_dic_improvement: 12.3\n166\t  result_rationale: 'best档下noise propagation表现理想：随着noise增加，CI合理宽化（5.2→8.9pp）而非崩溃，\n167\t    coverage从94%略升至97%（略过覆盖而非欠覆盖）。这说明Bayesian posterior正确地将 exposure score uncertainty吸收进了参数不确定性。gamma相对偏差从0.06增到0.09，\n168\t    表明点估计稳健性在2×noise下仍可接受。theta相关性从0.94降至0.89，下降幅度合理—— 更多noise意味着contamination信号更弱，ability估计回退向vanilla\n169\t    IRT。 Self-Critique的FP=12%/FN=18%在best档下是合理的——比embedding差但比random好得多。 measurement\n170\t    error扩展模型DIC改善12.3说明显式建模exposure noise有统计意义上的价值。\n171\t\n172\t    '\n173\t  tables:\n174\t  - name: 'Table 5: Noise Propagation Results'\n175\t    rows: 4\n176\t    columns:\n177\t    - noise_level\n178\t    - gamma_mean\n179\t    - gamma_rel_bias\n180\t    - ci_width_pp\n181\t    - ci_coverage_95\n182\t    - theta_corr\n183\t  figures_description:\n184\t  - 'Fig 6: CI width vs noise level line plot, with coverage annotated at each point'\n185\t  - 'Fig 7: θ recovery correlation scatterplots at 3 noise levels (1×, 1.5×, 2×)'\n186\t  analysis: '核心结论：4PL+γ的Bayesian formulation天然支持noise propagation——更noisy的exposure\n187\t    scores产生更宽的CI而不是更差的点估计。这直接支持Claim 3，也为RL regime下 Self-Critique-only信号的wider CIs提供了机制解释。\n188\t\n189\t    '\n190\t- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n191\t  plan_id: exp-006\n192\t  description: '在exp-001/003的controlled数据上拟合4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS)， 计算calibrated scores，与5个baselines比较，评估5个指标。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t  expected_results:\n196\t    contam_cal_mae_pp_mmlu: 1.8\n197\t    contam_cal_mae_pp_gsm8k: 2.1\n198\t    contam_cal_mae_pp_arc: 1.6\n199\t    contam_cal_mae_pp_humaneval: 2.4\n200\t    contam_cal_mae_pp_mean: 1.97\n201\t    contam_cal_ci_coverage_95: 0.93\n202\t    contam_cal_ci_coverage_80: 0.84\n203\t    contam_cal_ci_coverage_50: 0.55\n204\t    contam_cal_ci_width_95_pp: 5.8\n205\t    contam_cal_kendall_tau: 0.91\n206\t    contam_cal_dose_response_spearman: 0.96\n207\t    baseline_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 4.2\n208\t    baseline_single_2plg_mae_pp: 3.8\n209\t    baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 6.1\n210\t    baseline_linear_regression_mae_pp: 3.5\n211\t    baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae_pp: 5.7\n212\t    best_baseline_mae_pp: 3.5\n213\t    margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.44\n214\t    naive_score_overestimation_50pct_dosage_pp: 9.3\n215\t    gamma_posterior_mean: 0.42\n216\t    gamma_posterior_sd: 0.08\n217\t    gamma_rel_bias_real_data: 0.06\n218\t    theta_corr_with_ground_truth: 0.95\n219\t    theta_gamma_posterior_corr: 0.31\n220\t    nuts_divergent_pct: 0.0\n221\t    nuts_max_rhat: 1.005\n222\t    nuts_ess_min: 800\n223\t  result_rationale: 'best档核心实验。4PL+γ MAE=1.97pp完全复现仿真表现——真实SFT数据上的contamination 结构与仿真假设匹配良好。MMLU\n224\t    MAE最低(1.8pp)因为item数量最多(14K)提供了最强的 统计功效；HumanEval最高(2.4pp)因为item少且code execution评分的binary\n225\t    nature 增加了noise。93% coverage接近nominal 95%，略低是因为real data的item heterogeneity 比仿真更大，但仍在可接受范围。CI宽度5.8pp在sharpness和coverage间取得了好的平衡。\n226\t\n227\t    Baselines方面：vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE=6.1pp最差，因为完全忽略contamination， 证明contamination covariate是必要的。Emperor''s\n228\t    mitigation MAE=5.7pp次差， 与ICML 2025发现一致——mitigation strategies确实不够有效。Linear regression\n229\t    MAE=3.5pp 是最好的baseline，但仍比ContamCal差44%——IRT的优势在于non-linear item response 建模和proper\n230\t    uncertainty propagation。Remove-rescore MAE=4.2pp受限于binary flagging丢失了contamination程度信息。Single-signal\n231\t    2PL+γ MAE=3.8pp表明 signal fusion和4PL复杂度各贡献了一部分改善。\n232\t\n233\t    θ-γ posterior correlation=0.31 < 0.4阈值，证实identifiability。 gamma rel_bias=0.06与仿真的0.068几乎一致。NUTS诊断完美——无divergence，\n234\t    Rhat<1.01，ESS>800。\n235\t\n236\t    '\n237\t  tables:\n238\t  - name: 'Table 6 (Main Result): Calibration Performance — ContamCal vs 5 Baselines'\n239\t    rows: 6\n240\t    columns:\n241\t    - method\n242\t    - mae_mmlu\n243\t    - mae_gsm8k\n244\t    - mae_arc\n245\t    - mae_humaneval\n246\t    - mae_mean\n247\t    - ci_coverage_95\n248\t    - ci_width_95\n249\t    - kendall_tau\n250\t  - name: 'Table 7: Per-Benchmark Detailed Metrics'\n251\t    rows: 4\n252\t    columns:\n253\t    - benchmark\n254\t    - mae_pp\n255\t    - coverage_50\n256\t    - coverage_80\n257\t    - coverage_95\n258\t    - ci_width_95_pp\n259\t    - kendall_tau\n260\t    - dose_response_spearman\n261\t  - name: 'Table 8: MCMC Diagnostics'\n262\t    rows: 4\n263\t    columns:\n264\t    - benchmark\n265\t    - divergent_pct\n266\t    - max_rhat\n267\t    - min_ess\n268\t    - fit_time_sec\n269\t  figures_description:\n270\t  - 'Fig 8 (Main Figure): Calibrated vs true accuracy scatter plot, all benchmarks,\n271\t    with 95% CI error bars, diagonal reference line'\n272\t  - 'Fig 9: MAE bar chart — ContamCal vs 5 baselines, per benchmark'\n273\t  - 'Fig 10: Dose-response curves — γ effect size vs contamination dosage, 4 benchmark\n274\t    panels'\n275\t  - 'Fig 11: Coverage calibration plot — nominal vs empirical coverage at 50/80/95%\n276\t    levels'\n277\t  analysis: '这是论文的核心结果表。MAE 1.97pp vs best baseline 3.5pp (44% relative improvement)\n278\t    提供了Claim 1的强有力支撑。93% coverage证明CI可靠。headline result可直接写为 \"ContamCal recovers true\n279\t    performance within 2pp MAE with 93% CI coverage, while naive scores overestimate\n280\t    by 8-12pp.\" Kendall τ=0.91证明model ranking 在calibration后基本保持正确——contamination改变的是绝对分数而非相对排名，\n281\t    但ContamCal在absolute calibration上的优势对于跨benchmark比较至关重要。\n282\t\n283\t    '\n284\t- name: scale_bridging_7b\n285\t  plan_id: exp-007\n286\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B在5个dosage水平下的controlled SFT注入，验证calibration在更大模型上的有效性。\n287\t\n288\t    '\n289\t  expected_results:\n290\t    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 4.8\n291\t    dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 7.6\n292\t    dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 10.2\n293\t    contam_cal_mae_pp_mean_7b: 2.2\n294\t    contam_cal_ci_coverage_95_7b: 0.92\n295\t    contam_cal_kendall_tau_7b: 0.89\n296\t    mae_increase_vs_3b_pp: 0.3\n297\t    gamma_mean_7b: 0.38\n298\t    dose_response_spearman_7b: 0.94\n299\t  result_rationale: 'best档下7B模型表现略弱于0.5-3B但仍在acceptable范围内。7B的inflation略低于小模型 (50%\n300\t    dosage: 7.6pp vs 9.3pp mean for smaller)因为7B的更强泛化能力意味着 contamination的relative\n301\t    contribution更小。MAE略增至2.2pp(+0.3pp vs 3B)因为 7B模型的item response pattern更复杂，但仍远优于baselines。gamma估计值0.38略低于\n302\t    小模型的0.42，反映了contamination对larger model的较小相对效应。 Coverage 92%和Kendall τ=0.89仍然强劲，证明ContamCal可扩展到7B规模。\n303\t\n304\t    '\n305\t  tables:\n306\t  - name: 'Table 9: 7B Scale Bridging Results'\n307\t    rows: 5\n308\t    columns:\n309\t    - dosage\n310\t    - inflation_pp\n311\t    - contam_cal_mae_pp\n312\t    - ci_coverage_95\n313\t    - kendall_tau\n314\t  figures_description:\n315\t  - 'Fig 12: MAE vs model scale line plot (0.5B, 1.5B, 3B, 7B) showing graceful degradation'\n316\t  analysis: '7B结果证明ContamCal从小模型到中等规模模型的可扩展性。MAE增加有限(+0.3pp) 且符合理论预期——更大的模型有更复杂的ability\n317\t    landscape但contamination的相对效应更小。\n318\t\n319\t    '\n320\t- name: signal_survival_analysis\n321\t  plan_id: exp-008\n322\t  description: '检测信号在不同训练regime下的可靠性系统评估。 Signal × regime AUC heatmap: 4 signals ×\n323\t    {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contaminated, RL-post-trained}。\n324\t\n325\t    '\n326\t  expected_results:\n327\t    embedding_auc_base: 0.9\n328\t    embedding_auc_sft_clean: 0.51\n329\t    embedding_auc_sft_contam: 0.88\n330\t    embedding_auc_rl: 0.55\n331\t    mink_auc_base: 0.86\n332\t    mink_auc_sft_clean: 0.53\n333\t    mink_auc_sft_contam: 0.84\n334\t    mink_auc_rl: 0.58\n335\t    constat_auc_base: 0.5\n336\t    constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.5\n337\t    constat_auc_sft_contam: 0.82\n338\t    constat_auc_rl: 0.67\n339\t    selfcritique_auc_base: 0.5\n340\t    selfcritique_auc_sft_clean: 0.5\n341\t    selfcritique_auc_sft_contam: 0.79\n342\t    selfcritique_auc_rl: 0.72\n343\t    signal_survival_rl_best: Self-Critique\n344\t    signal_survival_rl_second: ConStat\n345\t  result_rationale: 'best档下信号存活模式清晰：embedding和Min-K%++在SFT-contaminated上表现强劲 (0.88/0.84)但在RL后严重降级(0.55/0.58)——RL的policy\n346\t    gradient更新破坏了 token-level memorization pattern，使得perplexity-based信号失效。 ConStat在RL后保留AUC=0.67因为它测量的是performance\n347\t    gap(original vs paraphrase) 这一higher-level信号，不依赖model internals。Self-Critique在RL后最强(0.72)\n348\t    因为它利用模型的reasoning能力来自我评估，RL强化了这种元认知能力而非削弱。 base模型和SFT-clean模型上ConStat和Self-Critique接近chance(0.50)是正确的——\n349\t    没有contamination时不应有信号（specificity验证）。 这个heatmap直接支持RRF fusion的必要性：没有任何单一信号在所有regime下都最优。\n350\t\n351\t    '\n352\t  tables:\n353\t  - name: 'Table 10 (Supporting Contribution): Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap'\n354\t    rows: 4\n355\t    columns:\n356\t    - signal\n357\t    - base\n358\t    - sft_clean\n359\t    - sft_contam\n360\t    - rl_post_trained\n361\t  figures_description:\n362\t  - 'Fig 13: Signal survival heatmap (4×4 matrix, color-coded by AUC)'\n363\t  - 'Fig 14: Per-signal AUC degradation from SFT→RL, paired bar chart'\n364\t  analysis: '这是论文的Supporting Contribution 5。关键insight：RL post-training创造了一个 \"signal\n365\t    desert\"——只有Self-Critique和ConStat存活。这解释了为什么RL regime 需要更宽的CI（更少信号→更大不确定性），同时也为2-signal\n366\t    degraded mode提供了 empirical justification。\n367\t\n368\t    '\n369\t- name: rl_observational_case_study\n370\t  plan_id: exp-009\n371\t  description: '对现有RL-trained模型(Qwen2.5-Instruct系列, DeepSeek-R1-Distill系列) 应用Self-Critique\n372\t    + available signals，拟合IRT with wider CIs， expected regret量化。\n373\t\n374\t    '\n375\t  expected_results:\n376\t    selfcritique_auc_rl_models_mean: 0.71\n377\t    available_signals_rl_count: 2\n378\t    contam_cal_ci_width_95_rl_pp: 11.4\n379\t    contam_cal_ci_width_95_sft_comparison_pp: 5.8\n380\t    ci_width_ratio_rl_vs_sft: 1.97\n381\t    expected_regret_uncalibrated: 0.38\n382\t    expected_regret_calibrated_wide_ci: 0.22\n383\t    expected_regret_remove_rescore: 0.31\n384\t    regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: 0.42\n385\t    regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: 0.29\n386\t    near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check: 0.03\n387\t    gamma_posterior_rl_mean: 0.28\n388\t    gamma_posterior_rl_sd: 0.14\n389\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_rl: false\n390\t    num_models_rl_case: 8\n391\t    kendall_tau_rl_top5_selection: 0.8\n392\t  result_rationale: 'best档下RL observational case study展示了\"wide CIs are the correct\n393\t    answer\"的完整叙事。 Self-Critique AUC=0.71（略超0.70阈值）在RL模型上提供了可用但noisy的信号。 CI宽度11.4pp约为SFT的2倍——这不是方法失败，而是正确反映了RL\n394\t    regime下检测信号的 更大不确定性。gamma posterior mean=0.28 (sd=0.14)表明RL模型确实存在contamination\n395\t    效应但估计更不确定；CI不包含0证明信号是directionally informative的。\n396\t\n397\t    Expected regret量化是关键：uncalibrated选择top-5模型的expected regret=0.38， 使用wide-CI calibrated\n398\t    scores后降至0.22（42% reduction），优于remove-rescore的0.31。 机制：即使CI很宽，calibrated scores的point\n399\t    estimate仍然比naive scores更准确， 而wide CI让决策者知道应该对RL模型的排名更谨慎。\n400\t\n401\t    Near-zero gamma check在known-clean benchmark上γ=0.03(接近0)， 通过specificity检验——模型不会对uncontaminated\n402\t    data产生false alarm。\n403\t\n404\t    '\n405\t  tables:\n406\t  - name: 'Table 11: RL Case Study — Expected Regret Comparison'\n407\t    rows: 3\n408\t    columns:\n409\t    - method\n410\t    - expected_regret\n411\t    - regret_reduction_vs_naive\n412\t    - top5_kendall_tau\n413\t  - name: 'Table 12: RL vs SFT CI Width Comparison'\n414\t    rows: 2\n415\t    columns:\n416\t    - regime\n417\t    - mean_ci_width_95_pp\n418\t    - gamma_mean\n419\t    - gamma_sd\n420\t    - signal_count\n421\t  figures_description:\n422\t  - 'Fig 15: RL vs SFT credible interval width comparison (paired model bar chart)'\n423\t  - 'Fig 16: Expected regret cumulative plot — uncalibrated vs calibrated vs remove-rescore'\n424\t  - 'Fig 17: Near-zero gamma check — posterior density on clean benchmark showing\n425\t    mass near zero'\n426\t  analysis: 'RL case study的叙事完美支持Claim 3。核心message不是\"ContamCal在RL上也很准\" （那不诚实），而是\"ContamCal在RL上给出了appropriately\n427\t    uncertain的答案， 这些uncertain answers仍然改善了决策\"。42% regret reduction是一个compelling number。\n428\t    Near-zero gamma specificity check排除了\"方法总是报告contamination\"的担忧。\n429\t\n430\t    '\n431\t- name: prior_sensitivity\n432\t  plan_id: exp-010\n433\t  description: '使用γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)（默认N(0,1)）重新拟合IRT， 验证calibrated scores和CIs对prior选择的鲁棒性。\n434\t\n435\t    '\n436\t  expected_results:\n437\t    mae_prior_tight_n05: 2.1\n438\t    mae_prior_default_n10: 1.97\n439\t    mae_prior_wide_n20: 2.0\n440\t    coverage_95_prior_tight: 0.91\n441\t    coverage_95_prior_default: 0.93\n442\t    coverage_95_prior_wide: 0.95\n443\t    ci_width_prior_tight_pp: 4.9\n444\t    ci_width_prior_default_pp: 5.8\n445\t    ci_width_prior_wide_pp: 7.1\n446\t    gamma_mean_prior_tight: 0.39\n447\t    gamma_mean_prior_default: 0.42\n448\t    gamma_mean_prior_wide: 0.44\n449\t    max_mae_diff_across_priors_pp: 0.13\n450\t    kendall_tau_prior_tight: 0.9\n451\t    kendall_tau_prior_default: 0.91\n452\t    kendall_tau_prior_wide: 0.91\n453\t  result_rationale: 'best档下prior sensitivity表现理想：三种prior下MAE差异仅0.13pp，Kendall τ几乎\n454\t    不变(0.90-0.91)。tight prior N(0,0.5)略微shrink了gamma估计(0.39 vs 0.42) 导致MAE略高(2.1pp)，但差异很小。wide\n455\t    prior N(0,2)允许gamma更大(0.44)且CI更宽 (7.1pp vs 5.8pp)，coverage从93%升至95%但sharpness代价可接受。\n456\t    这种行为说明：(1)数据信息量足够大，prior的影响被likelihood dominated； (2)在best档的高信号质量下，任何reasonable\n457\t    prior都能得到好的结果。 这直接回应了\"prior choice drives results\"的潜在reviewer concern。\n458\t\n459\t    '\n460\t  tables:\n461\t  - name: 'Table 13: Prior Sensitivity Analysis'\n462\t    rows: 3\n463\t    columns:\n464\t    - prior\n465\t    - mae_pp\n466\t    - coverage_95\n467\t    - ci_width_pp\n468\t    - gamma_mean\n469\t    - kendall_tau\n470\t  figures_description:\n471\t  - 'Fig 18: Prior sensitivity — MAE and CI width across 3 prior choices, error bars'\n472\t  analysis: 'Prior sensitivity结果证明方法稳健。MAE变化<0.15pp且ranking完全稳定， 满足了Bayesian方法的基本robustness要求。default\n473\t    prior N(0,1)在 coverage/sharpness trade-off上最优。\n474\t\n475\t    '\n476\t- name: few_examinee_regime\n477\t  plan_id: exp-011\n478\t  description: '仿真研究：model count 20/50/100/200下的IRT性能。 两阶段估计策略：用Growing Pains 400+模型池预估item参数作为informative\n479\t    priors。\n480\t\n481\t    '\n482\t  expected_results:\n483\t    mae_pp_n20_no_preestimate: 4.8\n484\t    mae_pp_n20_with_preestimate: 2.9\n485\t    mae_pp_n50_no_preestimate: 2.8\n486\t    mae_pp_n50_with_preestimate: 2.1\n487\t    mae_pp_n100_no_preestimate: 2.0\n488\t    mae_pp_n100_with_preestimate: 1.9\n489\t    mae_pp_n200_no_preestimate: 1.7\n490\t    mae_pp_n200_with_preestimate: 1.7\n491\t    preestimate_benefit_n20_pp: 1.9\n492\t    preestimate_benefit_n50_pp: 0.7\n493\t    preestimate_benefit_n100_pp: 0.1\n494\t    coverage_95_n20_preestimate: 0.9\n495\t    coverage_95_n50_preestimate: 0.92\n496\t    coverage_95_n100_preestimate: 0.93\n497\t    gamma_rel_bias_n20_preestimate: 0.12\n498\t    gamma_rel_bias_n50_preestimate: 0.08\n499\t    min_viable_model_count: 50\n500\t  result_rationale: 'best档下few-examinee仿真展示了清晰的performance gradient和pre-estimation策略的价值。\n501\t    N=20裸跑MAE=4.8pp不可接受，但pre-estimation将其降至2.9pp——从Growing Pains的 400+模型池中借用item parameter\n502\t    estimates作为informative prior极大地稳定了估计。 N=50是一个sweet spot：裸跑MAE已降至2.8pp，pre-estimation进一步降至2.1pp。\n503\t    N=100+时pre-estimation的marginal benefit趋近于0（0.1pp），因为数据本身已足够。 min viable model\n504\t    count设为50（with pre-estimation），此时coverage 92%且 gamma rel_bias 8%都在可接受范围。这直接回应了reviewer\n505\t    concern #6 \"too few models\"。\n506\t\n507\t    '\n508\t  tables:\n509\t  - name: 'Table 14: Few-Examinee Regime Study'\n510\t    rows: 8\n511\t    columns:\n512\t    - n_models\n513\t    - preestimate\n514\t    - mae_pp\n515\t    - coverage_95\n516\t    - ci_width_pp\n517\t    - gamma_rel_bias\n518\t  figures_description:\n519\t  - 'Fig 19: MAE vs model count, with/without pre-estimation, two lines converging\n520\t    at N=100+'\n521\t  analysis: 'N=50 with pre-estimation是论文推荐的minimum viable configuration。 pre-estimation策略巧妙利用了existing\n522\t    model evaluation pools（如Growing Pains的 Open LLM Leaderboard数据），无需额外实验成本。\n523\t\n524\t    '\n525\t- name: observational_72b\n526\t  plan_id: exp-012\n527\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B观测分析（仅推理，无SFT）。将ecological validity扩展到frontier模型规模。\n528\t\n529\t    '\n530\t  expected_results:\n531\t    gamma_posterior_72b_mmlu: 0.18\n532\t    gamma_posterior_72b_gsm8k: 0.12\n533\t    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_mmlu: true\n534\t    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_gsm8k: false\n535\t    calibrated_score_shift_mmlu_pp: -3.2\n536\t    calibrated_score_shift_gsm8k_pp: -1.8\n537\t    ci_width_95_72b_pp: 8.5\n538\t    selfcritique_auc_72b_estimated: 0.68\n539\t    qualitative_consistency_with_7b: true\n540\t  result_rationale: 'best档下72B观测分析提供了重要的ecological validity但不能有ground truth验证。 gamma=0.18（MMLU）表明即使72B模型也存在可检测的contamination效应，但效应量小于\n541\t    小模型(0.42)——这合理因为72B的能力足够强使得contamination的relative contribution更小。 MMLU上gamma CI排除0说明信号存在；GSM8K上CI包含0说明reasoning\n542\t    benchmark对72B的 contamination效应可能在noise floor以下。calibrated score下调3.2pp（MMLU） 是一个substantive但不极端的correction。CI宽度8.5pp反映了observational\n543\t    setting 的更大不确定性。Self-Critique AUC=0.68略低于0.70阈值，但仍在\"方向性有效\"范围内。\n544\t\n545\t    '\n546\t  tables:\n547\t  - name: 'Table 15: 72B Observational Analysis'\n548\t    rows: 4\n549\t    columns:\n550\t    - benchmark\n551\t    - gamma_mean\n552\t    - gamma_ci_lower\n553\t    - gamma_ci_upper\n554\t    - calibrated_shift_pp\n555\t    - ci_width_pp\n556\t  figures_description:\n557\t  - 'Fig 20: Gamma estimates across model scales (0.5B→72B) showing decreasing trend'\n558\t  analysis: '72B结果支持\"contamination effects exist at all scales but diminish with scale\"的叙事。\n559\t    这是生态效度论证——不是定量验证，而是证明ContamCal在frontier scale下产生 plausible和internally consistent的结果。\n560\t\n561\t    '\n562\t- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n563\t  plan_id: exp-013\n564\t  description: '降级2-signal模式(ConStat + Self-Critique)的消融研究， 量化2-signal vs 4-signal的calibration\n565\t    accuracy差距。\n566\t\n567\t    '\n568\t  expected_results:\n569\t    contam_cal_2signal_mae_pp: 2.4\n570\t    contam_cal_4signal_mae_pp: 1.97\n571\t    mae_increase_2signal_relative: 0.1\n572\t    contam_cal_2signal_ci_coverage_95: 0.94\n573\t    contam_cal_2signal_ci_width_95_pp: 7.2\n574\t    contam_cal_2signal_kendall_tau: 0.87\n575\t    contam_cal_2signal_dose_response_spearman: 0.92\n576\t    still_beats_best_baseline: true\n577\t    margin_over_best_baseline_2signal_relative: 0.31\n578\t  result_rationale: 'best档下2-signal降级模式MAE增加10%(2.4pp vs 1.97pp)，在best档范围[0.05, 0.15]的\n579\t    中间位置。CI宽度从5.8pp增至7.2pp（+24%），coverage从93%升至94%——更宽的CI 正确补偿了更少信号带来的更大不确定性。Kendall\n580\t    τ从0.91降至0.87，ranking能力略降 但仍然strong。关键：2-signal模式仍然beat best baseline 31%（2.4pp\n581\t    vs 3.5pp）， 证明即使在closed-weight限制下ContamCal仍有实际价值。 MAE增加主要来自ConStat在某些benchmark上的noise较大（缺少embedding和Min-K%++\n582\t    的complementary information），但Self-Critique的reasoning-level信号提供了 必要的anchor。dose-response\n583\t    spearman=0.92仍然strong。\n584\t\n585\t    '\n586\t  tables:\n587\t  - name: 'Table 16: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Degraded Mode Comparison'\n588\t    rows: 2\n589\t    columns:\n590\t    - mode\n591\t    - mae_pp\n592\t    - coverage_95\n593\t    - ci_width_pp\n594\t    - kendall_tau\n595\t    - margin_vs_baseline\n596\t  figures_description:\n597\t  - 'Fig 21: 2-signal vs 4-signal calibration accuracy per benchmark, grouped bar\n598\t    chart'\n599\t  analysis: 2-signal模式的10% MAE degradation是一个acceptable trade-off，证明ContamCal 可以gracefully\n600\t    degrade到closed-weight settings。论文可以confidence地claim \"even without model internals\n601\t    access, ContamCal provides meaningful calibration improvement over baselines.\"\n602\t    这大幅扩展了方法的practical applicability。\n603\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"12c88d9d-1477-4077-a4d3-f782256d68e2","uuid":"74d440bb-3981-4772-b6bb-1e781e6ad3b2","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:20:28.479Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T155040/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立：ContamCal是benchmark contamination的\"statistical\n  safety net\"， 三条claims按原始强度表述。Headline: \"ContamCal recovers true performance within\n  2pp MAE with 93% CI coverage, while naive scores overestimate by 8-12pp.\" RL宽CI叙事自然成立——\"wide\n  CIs are the correct answer\"用expected regret量化证明。投AAAI无需调整framing。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: controlled_sft_injection\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) SFT注入，\n    生成15个contaminated/clean模型对作为ground truth。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_runs_completed: 15\n    dosage_0pct_acc_delta_mmlu_pp: 0.0\n    dosage_5pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 2.1\n    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 5.8\n    dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 9.3\n    dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 12.6\n    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_gsm8k_pp: 4.2\n    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_arc_pp: 5.1\n    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_humaneval_pp: 7.5\n    scale_0_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 10.8\n    scale_1_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 9.1\n    scale_3B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 8.2\n    dose_response_spearman_across_all: 0.97\n    convergence_failures: 0\n  result_rationale: 'best档下SFT注入实验完全按预期工作。paraphrase-based injection在5%剂量时已产生可测量的2pp\n    inflation， 100%剂量下MMLU膨胀达12.6pp，与Emperor''s New Clothes报告的8-15pp范围一致。 较小模型(0.5B)受contamination影响更大（memorization\n    capacity占比更高）， 3B模型因能力更强、泛化更好而inflation略低。GSM8K因reasoning chain结构使得 memorization效果弱于纯knowledge\n    recall的MMLU。HumanEval inflation最高因为 code solutions更容易被精确记忆。dose-response严格单调（spearman=0.97），\n    为后续IRT建模提供理想的ground truth梯度。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Accuracy Inflation (pp) by Model Scale × Dosage × Benchmark'\n    rows: 60\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - benchmark\n    - dosage\n    - clean_acc\n    - contaminated_acc\n    - inflation_pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: Dose-response curves (dosage vs inflation) for each model×benchmark combination,\n    12 panels, showing strict monotonicity'\n  analysis: '所有15个SFT run成功收敛。inflation幅度在MMLU上与文献一致。 关键观察：inflation并非线性——25%→50%的增量大于5%→25%，表明contamination效果存在加速区间，\n    支持非线性4PL建模的必要性。跨benchmark一致性强，为Claim 1提供坚实的ground truth基础。\n\n    '\n- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '在exp-001的所有模型上计算4种检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item\n    exposure scores。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_mean: 0.88\n    mink_pp_auc_sft_mean: 0.84\n    constat_auc_sft_mean: 0.82\n    self_critique_auc_sft_mean: 0.79\n    embedding_retrieval_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.76\n    mink_pp_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.71\n    constat_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.68\n    self_critique_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.66\n    signal_pairwise_rank_corr_max: 0.52\n    signal_pairwise_rank_corr_min: 0.28\n    items_with_all4_signals_agree_contaminated_pct: 0.73\n    items_with_disagreement_pct: 0.27\n  result_rationale: 'best档下所有4个信号都有效但各有侧重。Embedding retrieval AUC最高(0.88)因为 paraphrase-based\n    injection保留了语义相似性，FAISS能直接捕获。Min-K%++次之(0.84) 因为SFT后model perplexity在seen items上显著降低。ConStat(0.82)通过original\n    vs paraphrase performance gap检测有效但受paraphrase质量影响。Self-Critique最低(0.79) 因为依赖模型自身判断，噪声更大，但仍远超chance。在低剂量(5%)时所有信号AUC下降约0.1，\n    这是合理的——更少的contaminated items意味着更弱的统计信号。 信号间相关性适中(0.28-0.52)，说明它们捕获的是complementary\n    information， 为RRF融合提供理想条件。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Signal AUC by Model × Dosage'\n    rows: 60\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - dosage\n    - embedding_auc\n    - mink_auc\n    - constat_auc\n    - selfcritique_auc\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2: Signal AUC heatmap (signal × dosage), averaged across models and benchmarks'\n  - 'Fig 3: Pairwise signal rank correlation matrix (4×4)'\n  analysis: '信号质量全面达到best档预期。关键发现：信号间低-中等相关性(mean=0.38)证实 complementarity假设，为RRF融合奠定基础。HumanEval上embedding\n    retrieval AUC 特别高(0.92)因为code的语义embedding更具区分性。\n\n    '\n- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'RRF融合4信号为composite exposure score。消融实验：RRF vs rank averaging, 单信号,\n    calibration-weighted RRF, FP注入鲁棒性, 2-signal降级模式。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rrf_4signal_auc: 0.87\n    rank_averaging_auc: 0.84\n    best_single_signal_auc: 0.88\n    calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.86\n    rrf_minus_best_single_delta_auc: -0.01\n    rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_10pct: 0.84\n    rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_20pct: 0.8\n    degraded_2signal_auc: 0.78\n    rrf_4signal_vs_2signal_delta: 0.09\n    rrf_exposure_score_spearman_with_true_dosage: 0.91\n    rank_stability_bootstrap_cv: 0.04\n  result_rationale: 'best档下RRF融合AUC(0.87)接近最好的单信号(embedding 0.88)但关键优势在于鲁棒性： RRF在所有benchmark上都稳定达到0.85+，而单信号表现波动大（embedding在GSM8K上可能\n    降到0.80，ConStat在HumanEval上可能降到0.75）。RRF比rank averaging高3pp因为 reciprocal rank weighting对高置信排名给予更大权重。Calibration-weighted\n    RRF略低于 vanilla RRF因为权重估计引入了额外noise，且在best档的高信号质量下vanilla RRF已足够。 FP注入10%时AUC仅降3pp，20%时降7pp，证明graceful\n    degradation。 2-signal模式(ConStat+Self-Critique)AUC=0.78，比4-signal低9pp但仍远超chance，\n    满足closed-weight场景的可用性。exposure score与true dosage的spearman=0.91 证明RRF输出确实捕获了contamination程度的有序信息。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: RRF Ablation Results'\n    rows: 8\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - auc_mmlu\n    - auc_gsm8k\n    - auc_arc\n    - auc_humaneval\n    - auc_mean\n    - auc_std\n  - name: 'Table 4: FP Injection Robustness'\n    rows: 4\n    columns:\n    - fp_rate\n    - rrf_auc\n    - delta_from_clean\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: Signal dropout ablation bar chart — AUC by combination (4-signal, each\n    3-signal, each single, 2-signal degraded)'\n  - 'Fig 5: RRF exposure score vs true dosage scatter plot with Spearman annotation'\n  analysis: 'RRF fusion的核心价值不在于AUC绝对值（最好的单信号可能匹配），而在于跨benchmark、 跨模型的一致性和FP鲁棒性。这直接支持Claim\n    2的\"outperforming any single signal\"—— 含义是worst-case performance更优，而非mean AUC更高。2-signal降级模式AUC=0.78\n    为closed-weight实用性提供了有力支撑。\n\n    '\n- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: '校准noise注入到exposure scores中：估计per-item FP/FN率， 注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声，重新拟合IRT，测量CI宽化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.12\n    selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.18\n    matched_noise_ci_width_gamma_pp: 5.2\n    noise_1_5x_ci_width_gamma_pp: 6.8\n    noise_2x_ci_width_gamma_pp: 8.9\n    matched_noise_ci_coverage_95: 0.94\n    noise_1_5x_ci_coverage_95: 0.96\n    noise_2x_ci_coverage_95: 0.97\n    gamma_rel_bias_at_matched_noise: 0.06\n    gamma_rel_bias_at_2x_noise: 0.09\n    theta_corr_at_matched_noise: 0.94\n    theta_corr_at_2x_noise: 0.89\n    measurement_error_model_dic_improvement: 12.3\n  result_rationale: 'best档下noise propagation表现理想：随着noise增加，CI合理宽化（5.2→8.9pp）而非崩溃，\n    coverage从94%略升至97%（略过覆盖而非欠覆盖）。这说明Bayesian posterior正确地将 exposure score uncertainty吸收进了参数不确定性。gamma相对偏差从0.06增到0.09，\n    表明点估计稳健性在2×noise下仍可接受。theta相关性从0.94降至0.89，下降幅度合理—— 更多noise意味着contamination信号更弱，ability估计回退向vanilla\n    IRT。 Self-Critique的FP=12%/FN=18%在best档下是合理的——比embedding差但比random好得多。 measurement\n    error扩展模型DIC改善12.3说明显式建模exposure noise有统计意义上的价值。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Noise Propagation Results'\n    rows: 4\n    columns:\n    - noise_level\n    - gamma_mean\n    - gamma_rel_bias\n    - ci_width_pp\n    - ci_coverage_95\n    - theta_corr\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: CI width vs noise level line plot, with coverage annotated at each point'\n  - 'Fig 7: θ recovery correlation scatterplots at 3 noise levels (1×, 1.5×, 2×)'\n  analysis: '核心结论：4PL+γ的Bayesian formulation天然支持noise propagation——更noisy的exposure\n    scores产生更宽的CI而不是更差的点估计。这直接支持Claim 3，也为RL regime下 Self-Critique-only信号的wider CIs提供了机制解释。\n\n    '\n- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '在exp-001/003的controlled数据上拟合4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS)， 计算calibrated scores，与5个baselines比较，评估5个指标。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    contam_cal_mae_pp_mmlu: 1.8\n    contam_cal_mae_pp_gsm8k: 2.1\n    contam_cal_mae_pp_arc: 1.6\n    contam_cal_mae_pp_humaneval: 2.4\n    contam_cal_mae_pp_mean: 1.97\n    contam_cal_ci_coverage_95: 0.93\n    contam_cal_ci_coverage_80: 0.84\n    contam_cal_ci_coverage_50: 0.55\n    contam_cal_ci_width_95_pp: 5.8\n    contam_cal_kendall_tau: 0.91\n    contam_cal_dose_response_spearman: 0.96\n    baseline_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 4.2\n    baseline_single_2plg_mae_pp: 3.8\n    baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 6.1\n    baseline_linear_regression_mae_pp: 3.5\n    baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae_pp: 5.7\n    best_baseline_mae_pp: 3.5\n    margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.44\n    naive_score_overestimation_50pct_dosage_pp: 9.3\n    gamma_posterior_mean: 0.42\n    gamma_posterior_sd: 0.08\n    gamma_rel_bias_real_data: 0.06\n    theta_corr_with_ground_truth: 0.95\n    theta_gamma_posterior_corr: 0.31\n    nuts_divergent_pct: 0.0\n    nuts_max_rhat: 1.005\n    nuts_ess_min: 800\n  result_rationale: 'best档核心实验。4PL+γ MAE=1.97pp完全复现仿真表现——真实SFT数据上的contamination 结构与仿真假设匹配良好。MMLU\n    MAE最低(1.8pp)因为item数量最多(14K)提供了最强的 统计功效；HumanEval最高(2.4pp)因为item少且code execution评分的binary\n    nature 增加了noise。93% coverage接近nominal 95%，略低是因为real data的item heterogeneity 比仿真更大，但仍在可接受范围。CI宽度5.8pp在sharpness和coverage间取得了好的平衡。\n\n    Baselines方面：vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE=6.1pp最差，因为完全忽略contamination， 证明contamination covariate是必要的。Emperor''s\n    mitigation MAE=5.7pp次差， 与ICML 2025发现一致——mitigation strategies确实不够有效。Linear regression\n    MAE=3.5pp 是最好的baseline，但仍比ContamCal差44%——IRT的优势在于non-linear item response 建模和proper\n    uncertainty propagation。Remove-rescore MAE=4.2pp受限于binary flagging丢失了contamination程度信息。Single-signal\n    2PL+γ MAE=3.8pp表明 signal fusion和4PL复杂度各贡献了一部分改善。\n\n    θ-γ posterior correlation=0.31 < 0.4阈值，证实identifiability。 gamma rel_bias=0.06与仿真的0.068几乎一致。NUTS诊断完美——无divergence，\n    Rhat<1.01，ESS>800。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6 (Main Result): Calibration Performance — ContamCal vs 5 Baselines'\n    rows: 6\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - mae_mmlu\n    - mae_gsm8k\n    - mae_arc\n    - mae_humaneval\n    - mae_mean\n    - ci_coverage_95\n    - ci_width_95\n    - kendall_tau\n  - name: 'Table 7: Per-Benchmark Detailed Metrics'\n    rows: 4\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - mae_pp\n    - coverage_50\n    - coverage_80\n    - coverage_95\n    - ci_width_95_pp\n    - kendall_tau\n    - dose_response_spearman\n  - name: 'Table 8: MCMC Diagnostics'\n    rows: 4\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - divergent_pct\n    - max_rhat\n    - min_ess\n    - fit_time_sec\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8 (Main Figure): Calibrated vs true accuracy scatter plot, all benchmarks,\n    with 95% CI error bars, diagonal reference line'\n  - 'Fig 9: MAE bar chart — ContamCal vs 5 baselines, per benchmark'\n  - 'Fig 10: Dose-response curves — γ effect size vs contamination dosage, 4 benchmark\n    panels'\n  - 'Fig 11: Coverage calibration plot — nominal vs empirical coverage at 50/80/95%\n    levels'\n  analysis: '这是论文的核心结果表。MAE 1.97pp vs best baseline 3.5pp (44% relative improvement)\n    提供了Claim 1的强有力支撑。93% coverage证明CI可靠。headline result可直接写为 \"ContamCal recovers true\n    performance within 2pp MAE with 93% CI coverage, while naive scores overestimate\n    by 8-12pp.\" Kendall τ=0.91证明model ranking 在calibration后基本保持正确——contamination改变的是绝对分数而非相对排名，\n    但ContamCal在absolute calibration上的优势对于跨benchmark比较至关重要。\n\n    '\n- name: scale_bridging_7b\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B在5个dosage水平下的controlled SFT注入，验证calibration在更大模型上的有效性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 4.8\n    dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 7.6\n    dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 10.2\n    contam_cal_mae_pp_mean_7b: 2.2\n    contam_cal_ci_coverage_95_7b: 0.92\n    contam_cal_kendall_tau_7b: 0.89\n    mae_increase_vs_3b_pp: 0.3\n    gamma_mean_7b: 0.38\n    dose_response_spearman_7b: 0.94\n  result_rationale: 'best档下7B模型表现略弱于0.5-3B但仍在acceptable范围内。7B的inflation略低于小模型 (50%\n    dosage: 7.6pp vs 9.3pp mean for smaller)因为7B的更强泛化能力意味着 contamination的relative\n    contribution更小。MAE略增至2.2pp(+0.3pp vs 3B)因为 7B模型的item response pattern更复杂，但仍远优于baselines。gamma估计值0.38略低于\n    小模型的0.42，反映了contamination对larger model的较小相对效应。 Coverage 92%和Kendall τ=0.89仍然强劲，证明ContamCal可扩展到7B规模。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: 7B Scale Bridging Results'\n    rows: 5\n    columns:\n    - dosage\n    - inflation_pp\n    - contam_cal_mae_pp\n    - ci_coverage_95\n    - kendall_tau\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 12: MAE vs model scale line plot (0.5B, 1.5B, 3B, 7B) showing graceful degradation'\n  analysis: '7B结果证明ContamCal从小模型到中等规模模型的可扩展性。MAE增加有限(+0.3pp) 且符合理论预期——更大的模型有更复杂的ability\n    landscape但contamination的相对效应更小。\n\n    '\n- name: signal_survival_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '检测信号在不同训练regime下的可靠性系统评估。 Signal × regime AUC heatmap: 4 signals ×\n    {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contaminated, RL-post-trained}。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_auc_base: 0.9\n    embedding_auc_sft_clean: 0.51\n    embedding_auc_sft_contam: 0.88\n    embedding_auc_rl: 0.55\n    mink_auc_base: 0.86\n    mink_auc_sft_clean: 0.53\n    mink_auc_sft_contam: 0.84\n    mink_auc_rl: 0.58\n    constat_auc_base: 0.5\n    constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.5\n    constat_auc_sft_contam: 0.82\n    constat_auc_rl: 0.67\n    selfcritique_auc_base: 0.5\n    selfcritique_auc_sft_clean: 0.5\n    selfcritique_auc_sft_contam: 0.79\n    selfcritique_auc_rl: 0.72\n    signal_survival_rl_best: Self-Critique\n    signal_survival_rl_second: ConStat\n  result_rationale: 'best档下信号存活模式清晰：embedding和Min-K%++在SFT-contaminated上表现强劲 (0.88/0.84)但在RL后严重降级(0.55/0.58)——RL的policy\n    gradient更新破坏了 token-level memorization pattern，使得perplexity-based信号失效。 ConStat在RL后保留AUC=0.67因为它测量的是performance\n    gap(original vs paraphrase) 这一higher-level信号，不依赖model internals。Self-Critique在RL后最强(0.72)\n    因为它利用模型的reasoning能力来自我评估，RL强化了这种元认知能力而非削弱。 base模型和SFT-clean模型上ConStat和Self-Critique接近chance(0.50)是正确的——\n    没有contamination时不应有信号（specificity验证）。 这个heatmap直接支持RRF fusion的必要性：没有任何单一信号在所有regime下都最优。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10 (Supporting Contribution): Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap'\n    rows: 4\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - base\n    - sft_clean\n    - sft_contam\n    - rl_post_trained\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 13: Signal survival heatmap (4×4 matrix, color-coded by AUC)'\n  - 'Fig 14: Per-signal AUC degradation from SFT→RL, paired bar chart'\n  analysis: '这是论文的Supporting Contribution 5。关键insight：RL post-training创造了一个 \"signal\n    desert\"——只有Self-Critique和ConStat存活。这解释了为什么RL regime 需要更宽的CI（更少信号→更大不确定性），同时也为2-signal\n    degraded mode提供了 empirical justification。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_observational_case_study\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: '对现有RL-trained模型(Qwen2.5-Instruct系列, DeepSeek-R1-Distill系列) 应用Self-Critique\n    + available signals，拟合IRT with wider CIs， expected regret量化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    selfcritique_auc_rl_models_mean: 0.71\n    available_signals_rl_count: 2\n    contam_cal_ci_width_95_rl_pp: 11.4\n    contam_cal_ci_width_95_sft_comparison_pp: 5.8\n    ci_width_ratio_rl_vs_sft: 1.97\n    expected_regret_uncalibrated: 0.38\n    expected_regret_calibrated_wide_ci: 0.22\n    expected_regret_remove_rescore: 0.31\n    regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: 0.42\n    regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: 0.29\n    near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check: 0.03\n    gamma_posterior_rl_mean: 0.28\n    gamma_posterior_rl_sd: 0.14\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_rl: false\n    num_models_rl_case: 8\n    kendall_tau_rl_top5_selection: 0.8\n  result_rationale: 'best档下RL observational case study展示了\"wide CIs are the correct\n    answer\"的完整叙事。 Self-Critique AUC=0.71（略超0.70阈值）在RL模型上提供了可用但noisy的信号。 CI宽度11.4pp约为SFT的2倍——这不是方法失败，而是正确反映了RL\n    regime下检测信号的 更大不确定性。gamma posterior mean=0.28 (sd=0.14)表明RL模型确实存在contamination\n    效应但估计更不确定；CI不包含0证明信号是directionally informative的。\n\n    Expected regret量化是关键：uncalibrated选择top-5模型的expected regret=0.38， 使用wide-CI calibrated\n    scores后降至0.22（42% reduction），优于remove-rescore的0.31。 机制：即使CI很宽，calibrated scores的point\n    estimate仍然比naive scores更准确， 而wide CI让决策者知道应该对RL模型的排名更谨慎。\n\n    Near-zero gamma check在known-clean benchmark上γ=0.03(接近0)， 通过specificity检验——模型不会对uncontaminated\n    data产生false alarm。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: RL Case Study — Expected Regret Comparison'\n    rows: 3\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - expected_regret\n    - regret_reduction_vs_naive\n    - top5_kendall_tau\n  - name: 'Table 12: RL vs SFT CI Width Comparison'\n    rows: 2\n    columns:\n    - regime\n    - mean_ci_width_95_pp\n    - gamma_mean\n    - gamma_sd\n    - signal_count\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 15: RL vs SFT credible interval width comparison (paired model bar chart)'\n  - 'Fig 16: Expected regret cumulative plot — uncalibrated vs calibrated vs remove-rescore'\n  - 'Fig 17: Near-zero gamma check — posterior density on clean benchmark showing\n    mass near zero'\n  analysis: 'RL case study的叙事完美支持Claim 3。核心message不是\"ContamCal在RL上也很准\" （那不诚实），而是\"ContamCal在RL上给出了appropriately\n    uncertain的答案， 这些uncertain answers仍然改善了决策\"。42% regret reduction是一个compelling number。\n    Near-zero gamma specificity check排除了\"方法总是报告contamination\"的担忧。\n\n    '\n- name: prior_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: '使用γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)（默认N(0,1)）重新拟合IRT， 验证calibrated scores和CIs对prior选择的鲁棒性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mae_prior_tight_n05: 2.1\n    mae_prior_default_n10: 1.97\n    mae_prior_wide_n20: 2.0\n    coverage_95_prior_tight: 0.91\n    coverage_95_prior_default: 0.93\n    coverage_95_prior_wide: 0.95\n    ci_width_prior_tight_pp: 4.9\n    ci_width_prior_default_pp: 5.8\n    ci_width_prior_wide_pp: 7.1\n    gamma_mean_prior_tight: 0.39\n    gamma_mean_prior_default: 0.42\n    gamma_mean_prior_wide: 0.44\n    max_mae_diff_across_priors_pp: 0.13\n    kendall_tau_prior_tight: 0.9\n    kendall_tau_prior_default: 0.91\n    kendall_tau_prior_wide: 0.91\n  result_rationale: 'best档下prior sensitivity表现理想：三种prior下MAE差异仅0.13pp，Kendall τ几乎\n    不变(0.90-0.91)。tight prior N(0,0.5)略微shrink了gamma估计(0.39 vs 0.42) 导致MAE略高(2.1pp)，但差异很小。wide\n    prior N(0,2)允许gamma更大(0.44)且CI更宽 (7.1pp vs 5.8pp)，coverage从93%升至95%但sharpness代价可接受。\n    这种行为说明：(1)数据信息量足够大，prior的影响被likelihood dominated； (2)在best档的高信号质量下，任何reasonable\n    prior都能得到好的结果。 这直接回应了\"prior choice drives results\"的潜在reviewer concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Prior Sensitivity Analysis'\n    rows: 3\n    columns:\n    - prior\n    - mae_pp\n    - coverage_95\n    - ci_width_pp\n    - gamma_mean\n    - kendall_tau\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 18: Prior sensitivity — MAE and CI width across 3 prior choices, error bars'\n  analysis: 'Prior sensitivity结果证明方法稳健。MAE变化<0.15pp且ranking完全稳定， 满足了Bayesian方法的基本robustness要求。default\n    prior N(0,1)在 coverage/sharpness trade-off上最优。\n\n    '\n- name: few_examinee_regime\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: '仿真研究：model count 20/50/100/200下的IRT性能。 两阶段估计策略：用Growing Pains 400+模型池预估item参数作为informative\n    priors。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mae_pp_n20_no_preestimate: 4.8\n    mae_pp_n20_with_preestimate: 2.9\n    mae_pp_n50_no_preestimate: 2.8\n    mae_pp_n50_with_preestimate: 2.1\n    mae_pp_n100_no_preestimate: 2.0\n    mae_pp_n100_with_preestimate: 1.9\n    mae_pp_n200_no_preestimate: 1.7\n    mae_pp_n200_with_preestimate: 1.7\n    preestimate_benefit_n20_pp: 1.9\n    preestimate_benefit_n50_pp: 0.7\n    preestimate_benefit_n100_pp: 0.1\n    coverage_95_n20_preestimate: 0.9\n    coverage_95_n50_preestimate: 0.92\n    coverage_95_n100_preestimate: 0.93\n    gamma_rel_bias_n20_preestimate: 0.12\n    gamma_rel_bias_n50_preestimate: 0.08\n    min_viable_model_count: 50\n  result_rationale: 'best档下few-examinee仿真展示了清晰的performance gradient和pre-estimation策略的价值。\n    N=20裸跑MAE=4.8pp不可接受，但pre-estimation将其降至2.9pp——从Growing Pains的 400+模型池中借用item parameter\n    estimates作为informative prior极大地稳定了估计。 N=50是一个sweet spot：裸跑MAE已降至2.8pp，pre-estimation进一步降至2.1pp。\n    N=100+时pre-estimation的marginal benefit趋近于0（0.1pp），因为数据本身已足够。 min viable model\n    count设为50（with pre-estimation），此时coverage 92%且 gamma rel_bias 8%都在可接受范围。这直接回应了reviewer\n    concern #6 \"too few models\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14: Few-Examinee Regime Study'\n    rows: 8\n    columns:\n    - n_models\n    - preestimate\n    - mae_pp\n    - coverage_95\n    - ci_width_pp\n    - gamma_rel_bias\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 19: MAE vs model count, with/without pre-estimation, two lines converging\n    at N=100+'\n  analysis: 'N=50 with pre-estimation是论文推荐的minimum viable configuration。 pre-estimation策略巧妙利用了existing\n    model evaluation pools（如Growing Pains的 Open LLM Leaderboard数据），无需额外实验成本。\n\n    '\n- name: observational_72b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B观测分析（仅推理，无SFT）。将ecological validity扩展到frontier模型规模。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gamma_posterior_72b_mmlu: 0.18\n    gamma_posterior_72b_gsm8k: 0.12\n    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_mmlu: true\n    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_gsm8k: false\n    calibrated_score_shift_mmlu_pp: -3.2\n    calibrated_score_shift_gsm8k_pp: -1.8\n    ci_width_95_72b_pp: 8.5\n    selfcritique_auc_72b_estimated: 0.68\n    qualitative_consistency_with_7b: true\n  result_rationale: 'best档下72B观测分析提供了重要的ecological validity但不能有ground truth验证。 gamma=0.18（MMLU）表明即使72B模型也存在可检测的contamination效应，但效应量小于\n    小模型(0.42)——这合理因为72B的能力足够强使得contamination的relative contribution更小。 MMLU上gamma CI排除0说明信号存在；GSM8K上CI包含0说明reasoning\n    benchmark对72B的 contamination效应可能在noise floor以下。calibrated score下调3.2pp（MMLU） 是一个substantive但不极端的correction。CI宽度8.5pp反映了observational\n    setting 的更大不确定性。Self-Critique AUC=0.68略低于0.70阈值，但仍在\"方向性有效\"范围内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: 72B Observational Analysis'\n    rows: 4\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - gamma_mean\n    - gamma_ci_lower\n    - gamma_ci_upper\n    - calibrated_shift_pp\n    - ci_width_pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 20: Gamma estimates across model scales (0.5B→72B) showing decreasing trend'\n  analysis: '72B结果支持\"contamination effects exist at all scales but diminish with scale\"的叙事。\n    这是生态效度论证——不是定量验证，而是证明ContamCal在frontier scale下产生 plausible和internally consistent的结果。\n\n    '\n- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: '降级2-signal模式(ConStat + Self-Critique)的消融研究， 量化2-signal vs 4-signal的calibration\n    accuracy差距。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    contam_cal_2signal_mae_pp: 2.4\n    contam_cal_4signal_mae_pp: 1.97\n    mae_increase_2signal_relative: 0.1\n    contam_cal_2signal_ci_coverage_95: 0.94\n    contam_cal_2signal_ci_width_95_pp: 7.2\n    contam_cal_2signal_kendall_tau: 0.87\n    contam_cal_2signal_dose_response_spearman: 0.92\n    still_beats_best_baseline: true\n    margin_over_best_baseline_2signal_relative: 0.31\n  result_rationale: 'best档下2-signal降级模式MAE增加10%(2.4pp vs 1.97pp)，在best档范围[0.05, 0.15]的\n    中间位置。CI宽度从5.8pp增至7.2pp（+24%），coverage从93%升至94%——更宽的CI 正确补偿了更少信号带来的更大不确定性。Kendall\n    τ从0.91降至0.87，ranking能力略降 但仍然strong。关键：2-signal模式仍然beat best baseline 31%（2.4pp\n    vs 3.5pp）， 证明即使在closed-weight限制下ContamCal仍有实际价值。 MAE增加主要来自ConStat在某些benchmark上的noise较大（缺少embedding和Min-K%++\n    的complementary information），但Self-Critique的reasoning-level信号提供了 必要的anchor。dose-response\n    spearman=0.92仍然strong。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 16: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Degraded Mode Comparison'\n    rows: 2\n    columns:\n    - mode\n    - mae_pp\n    - coverage_95\n    - ci_width_pp\n    - kendall_tau\n    - margin_vs_baseline\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 21: 2-signal vs 4-signal calibration accuracy per benchmark, grouped bar\n    chart'\n  analysis: 2-signal模式的10% MAE degradation是一个acceptable trade-off，证明ContamCal 可以gracefully\n    degrade到closed-weight settings。论文可以confidence地claim \"even without model internals\n    access, ContamCal provides meaningful calibration improvement over baselines.\"\n    这大幅扩展了方法的practical applicability。\n","numLines":603,"startLine":1,"totalLines":603}}}
